    "  \"purpose\": \"Repository-level requirements for terminal operation contracts, software requirements specifications, and agent-oriented semantic projections.\",",
    "  \"normative_terms\": {",
    "    \"SHALL\": \"Mandatory requirement; implementation and verification must satisfy it.\",",
    "    \"SHOULD\": \"Recommended procedure, subordinate to the mandatory requirements.\"",
